      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Cahokia Mounds State Historic Site, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, covers 2,200 acres just outside Collinsville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
