      ],
      "source": "https://www.riversandroutes.com/blog/travel-back-in-time-in-collinsville/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Okatibbee Dam creates Okatibbee Lake, a 5.9-square-mile reservoir on Collinsville’s eastern edge.",
